  "upvotes": 1,
  "body": "Starting a thread to promote collaboration among 3PAOs during the Pilot Phase (and maybe beyond)\r\n\r\nTo start off with I created a package for exporting information out of Vanta\r\nhttps://www.npmjs.com/package/vanta-auditor-tui\r\nIt might prove useful in other auditor workflows as they begin to use Vanta more as a 20x Tool\r\nVanta also has a TS SDK (which is what I used for this tool) you might want to check out https://github.com/VantaInc/vanta-auditor-api-sdk-typescript\r\n\r\nHope it helps and hope to see more collaboration among 3PAOs 🍻",
